/bad.sym: code BLANK: no geometry
/bad.sym: code NOPIN: designator prefix but no pins
/bad.sym: code OFFGRID: pin 2 at 6,-3 is not on a whole unit
/bad.sym: code REPEAT: pin name A repeats
/bad.sym: code UNTYPED: pin 2 untyped in a typed library
/bad.sym: code NINE: 9 pins, the loader keeps 8
/bad.sym: code GOOD defined twice
bad=7
